{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29916","headline":"都堂试贡士日庆春雪 · 李景","name":"都堂试贡士日庆春雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密雪分天路，羣才坐粉廊。\n霭空迷昼景，临宇借寒光。\n似暖花消地，无声玉满堂。\n洒池偏误曲，留砚忽因方。\n几处曹风比，何人谢赋长。\n春晖早相照，莫滞九衢芳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李景","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}